{
  "id": "1SA.17",
  "number": "17",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "1 Samweli 17",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 58,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "17",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "17",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Goliato ogochaaya Abaisraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafirisiti bagasangereria abarwani babo korwana esegi agwo Soko, omochie ore ase orogongo rwa Yuda. Bagatoora aase akorokwa Efesi‐Damimu, egati ya Soko na Aseka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo amo n’Abaisraeli bagasangererekana, bagatoora ase ense omweremo ekorokwa Ela; nabarabwo bakarobera korwana n’Abafilisti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafirisiti bagatenena ase egetunwa ekemo, na Abaisraeli ase ekende, ne rikura ndiareenge ase egati yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio agwo omonto ore korokwa Goliato, omonto bw’omochie o Gati, akaoroka korwa ase egetwori ki’Abafilisti. Ere nigo areenge etuoni y’eseegi; obotaambe bwaye nigo bwareenge bw’ekerengo ki’amaboko atano na rimo na ekeng’ese.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo abegete ekegogwa gi’etai na egoti yaroisirie korwa ase ebioma, na oborito bw’egoti eyio nigo bwareenge koreng’ana chikiro emerongo etano, na isano na ibere (57).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase amagoro aye nigo anaarete ebitange bi’etai, boigo nabwate esimisi y’etai abegete ireko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orotanga rwe ritimo riaye nigo rware buna omwaro omonene na oborito bw’ensonga ye ritimo riaye nigo bwareenge koreng’ana chikiro isano na ibere. Omonto ore komobogoreria enguba nigo areenge komotang’ana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goliato agacha bosio, agaaka eriogi ase abarwani b’Abaisraeli, akabora: “Nase ki mwachire na korobera ase okorwana esegi? Inee! Inche tindi Omofilisti, nainwe nabasomba ba Saulo? Chora omonto oyomo oino ache aa ase ’nde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto oyio karanyare korwana nainche na kong’ita, rirorio intwe natobe abasomba baino, korende kondamobue na komoita, rirorio inwe mobe abasomba baito, motokorere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omofilisti oria akagenderera gokwana, agateeba: “Nachayiire emeganda y’abarwani b’Abaisraeli ase rituko ria reero. Ing’a omonto, torwane nere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Saulo amo n’Abaisraeli bonsi baigwete amang’ana ’Omofilisti oria, bagaichana na kwoboa mono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi ase egetwori gia Saulo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi nigo areenge omwana o Yese, Omoefarati korwa Bethlehemu ase orogongo rwa Yuda. Yese nigo abwate abamura batano na batato, na ase amatuko aria Saulo areenge omorwoti, Yese konya ogotire mono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abamura baye batato abanene konya bachiire korwana esegi amo na Saulo. Omomura oria omotangi nigo are korokwa Eliabu na oyo o kabere Abinadabu, na oyo o gatato Sama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi nere orenge omoke ase bonsi. Abwo batato abanene bakaba bakomobwatia Saulo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende engaki ase engaki Daudi nigo areenge gotiga Saulo ogenda Bethlehemu korisia ching’ondi chia ise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engaki y’amatuko emerongo ene, chimambia na emegoroba, Omofilisti oria nigo areenge gocha bosio, otenenao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rituko erimo Yese agateebia Daudi, omwana oye: “Imokia ebigara ebi bisambire, ebitonga bibere, oimokie nemegati eye ikomi ogende bwango, obiirere bamura bamino aaria ase egetwori.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boigo oirere omochiki obo bw’abarwani elifu eyemo amabomba aya ikomi ay’amabeere abwatanire. Orore gose bamura bamino mbuya bare, naende ondetere ekemanyererio gete korwa ase bare, erinde imanye buna bagendererete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo, na bamura bamino, na Abaisraeli bonsi nao bakare ase ense omweremo ya Ela korwana n’Abafilisti.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rituko ria kabere, mambia chuni, Daudi agatigera omonto onde okorisia ching’ondi, akaimokia chindagera chiria, akagenda buna Yese konya amochikiire. Ekero aigete ensinyo y’egetwori ase chigari chiabekire chigekengerete, akanyora emeganda konya yarobeire gochia korwana esegi yareenge goaka eriogi ri’eseegi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisraeli bakeroberia ase okorwana na Abafirisiti boigo, na emeganda eyio ebere nigo yarigereranetie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi agatiga endagera eyio ase omorendi bw’ebinto bi’eseegi, akaminyoka gochia ase abarwani. Gaikireo agakwania abamwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Daudi areenge gokwana nabarabwo, Goliato, etuoni eria, Omofilisti korwa Gati, akarua aase Abafirisiti baroberete, akagenda bosio, agakwana amang’ana aria anarete gokwana botaambe, na Daudi akayaigwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Abaisraeli baroche Goliato, bagatama bonsi, bakamwoboa mono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisraeli bagakwana na goteebania: “Morooche omonto oria ogocha? Nigo agocha ogotochaaya intwe Abaisraeli. Omorwoti oito naria eira ng’a natenenkie omonto oraite Goliato. Boigo namoe omoiseke oye abe mokaye, naende eamate yaye etigwe, teakana ebango ase egati y’Abaisraeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Daudi agakwana na’baanto bateneine ang’e nere, akababoria: “Inee! Omonto oraite Omofilisti oria, na koruseria Abaisraeli ogochaaywa okwo, inki araegwe? Omofilisti oyo otarogeti, ninki aisaine goika are noboremu gochaaya emeganda y’eseegi ya Nyasae ore moyo?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto bakairaneria, bakamoteebia: “Amang’ana aria aria arakorerwe oyo oraite omonto oria.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliabu, omomura omonene omwabo Daudi, akaigwa buna agokwana na’baanto. Akaba nendamwamu enene ase Daudi, agateeba: “Ninki kiagera gwachicha aa? Ning’o gwatigera riicho riria rike rie ching’ondi chikare nka aaria ase erooro? Nimanyete oboenenu bwao na obobe bore ase enkoro yao. Nigo gwacha aa korora esegi rioka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi agateeba: “Ninki nakora rende? Nokoboria gwoka naboria.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Daudi akeonchora gochia ase omonto onde akabooria amang’ana aria konya aboririe, na Abanto bakamoiraneria buna konya bamoiraneirie ritang’ani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Abanto baigwete amang’ana a Daudi, bakagenda bakayateebia Saulo, na Saulo akamorangeria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi agateebia Saulo: “Monto onde takwa omoyo ase okomwoboa Omofilisti oyio. Inche, omosomba oo, ningende komorwania.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo agakania Daudi, akamoteebia: “Tokonyara korwania Omofilisti oyio. Aye nomoke; ere nigo enaretie korwana esegi korwa obosae bwaye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Daudi agateebia Saulo: “Inche, omosomba oo, nabeire nkorisia ching’ondi chia tata, na ekero kende gionsi endo gose edubu yaare gocha koira eng’ondi korwa ase riicho,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nigo nare koyeromeng’ana na koyeaka inse, naende natooria eng’ondi eria korwa ase omonwa oye, na onye endo gose edubu yaare kondindokera, nigo nare koyebwata chinderu, erinde nayeaka nayeita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche, omosomba oo, nabeire ngoita chindo ne chidubu, naboigo buna nakorete ching’iti chiria ninkore n’Omofilisti oria otarogeti, oyochayiire emeganda y’eseegi ya Nyasae ore moyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende Daudi agateeba: “Omonene oria ontooretie korwa ase chinchara chi’endo na echi’edubu, nigo arantoorie korwa ase amaboko y’Omofilisti oria.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Saulo akamoteebia: “Gaki genda, n’Omonene abe amo naye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Saulo akaimokia ebirwanero biaye bi’eseegi, akabibekera Daudi, akamobekera ekegogwa gi’etai omotwe oye, na egoti eroisirie korwa ase ebioma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi akeboerania ebirwanero ebio amo nomoyio o birende, agateema kogenda, ekiagera konya taranara kweboerania ebinto buna ebio. Erio agateebia Saulo: “Tinkonyara gotaara nyeboeranetie ebinto ebio, ekiagera timbinareti.” Akabirusia na kobitiga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio akaimokia enyimbo yaye ase okoboko kwaye, agachora amagena atano amaterere korwa ase akarooche, akayabeeka ase esaro yaye y’oborisia, akabogoria ne’nduruche koboko kwaye. Na bono agasuka gochia ang’e n’Omofilisti oria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi ogoita Goliato",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omofilisti oria agacha bosio, akamoika Daudi ang’e, na omobogoreria bw’enguba yaye omotang’aine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Omofilisti oria aroche Daudi oyorenge omosae omobariri na omonyakieni, akamochaaya mono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio agateebia Daudi: “Inee! Nesese inde? Ogonchichera nenyimbo?” Agatiana ase chinyasae chiaye, akaragereria Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende Omofilisti oria agateebia Daudi: “Inchuo aiga ase ’nde, nainche ning’ee chinyoni ne ching’iti chi’orosana chinyama chi’omobere oo chichirie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi akamoiraneria: “Aye nigo ogonchichera kore n’omoro, ne ritimo, na esimisi, korende inche nigo nkogochera ase erieta ri’Omonene bw’Emeganda, Nyasae bw’emeganda y’eseegi y’Abaisraeli, oyio gwachayire na komochecheria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rituko ria rero Omonene nakobeke ase okoboko kwane. Ninkoiyerie inse, na kobutora omotwe oo; ning’ee chinyoni ne ching’iti chi’orosana emebere ekwete y’abarwani b’Abafilisti; erio Abanto b’ense yonsi mbamanye ng’a Abaisraeli nigo bare na Nyasae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boigo omoganda oyo bwonsi nomanye ng’a Omonene tari korenta obobui ase enchera y’emioro na amatimo. Esegi nigo ere ey’Omonene, nere nababeeke inwe ase amaboko aito.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omofilisti oria agaachaka kogenda goikera Daudi ang’e, erio Daudi akaminyoka bwango gochia ase abarwani koumerana n’Omofilisti oria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi agasoyia okoboko kwaye ase esaro, akarusia rigena, akariruta nenduruche, agaaka Omofilisti oria obosio bwaye. Rigena riria rikarimera obosio bwaye ime, na ere akagwa inse maumama, agakwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase igo Daudi akabua Omofilisti oria, akamoita ne rigena ri’enduruche atari n’omoro koboko kwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio akaminyoka, agatenena ase omobere oye, agasomora omoyio oye korwa ase ekegocho, akamoita kegima ase okomobutora omotwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.51"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ekero Abafirisiti baroche ng’a etuoni yabo yakuure, bagatama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Abaisraeli na Abayuda bagaaka eriogi bakabwatia Abafirisiti goikera Gati na ebiita bi’Ekironi. Abafirisiti abaitetwe bakaraara ase enchera korwa Saaraimu goikera Gati na Ekironi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Abaisraeli bakairana korwa ase baseretie Abafirisiti bagasakora egetwori kiabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi akaimokia omotwe bw’Omofilisti oria akayoira Yerusalemu, korende ebirwanero bia Goliato akabigacha ase eema yaye omonyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.54"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi ogochia komenya amo na Saulo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Saulo aroche Daudi okogenda korwania Omofilisti oria akabooria Abineri, omochiki bw’emeganda y’abarwani: “Abineri, omosae oyo, noyo ng’o”?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.55"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abineri akamoiraneria: “Aye omorwoti, ekeene buna ore moyo, inche timomanyeti.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.55"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti agateebia Abineri: “Genda oboorie omanye gose omosae oyo noyo ng’o?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.56"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio ekero Daudi areenge koirana ase egetwori gaitire Omofilisti oria, Abineri akamoira ase Saulo, Daudi nigo abogoretie omotwe o Goliato koboko kwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.57"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo akamobooria: “Omosae oyo, noyo ng’o ore?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.58"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi akamoiraneria: “Inche nomwana bw’omosomba oo, Yese o Bethlehemu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
